###################################
#         AEVOL PARAMETERS        #
###################################
#
# Baseline Aevol 4b parameter file for the mutation-rate simulation scaffold.
# The pipeline generates condition-specific copies that scale only:
#
#   POINT_MUTATION_RATE
#   SMALL_INSERTION_RATE
#   SMALL_DELETION_RATE

########## Size of the initial random chromosome to generate ##########
CHROMOSOME_INITIAL_LENGTH   5000

########## Random generator setup (patched by scripts) ##########
SEED    5000

########## Population Structure and Selection ##########
GRID_SIZE           32 32
SELECTION_SCOPE     local 3 3
SELECTION_SCHEME    fitness_proportionate   1000

########## Mutation rates ##########
POINT_MUTATION_RATE     5e-5
SMALL_INSERTION_RATE    5e-5
SMALL_DELETION_RATE     5e-5
MAX_INDEL_SIZE          6

########## Rearrangement rates ##########
DUPLICATION_RATE        5e-5
DELETION_RATE           5e-5
TRANSLOCATION_RATE      5e-5
INVERSION_RATE          5e-5

########## Genomic constraints ##########
MIN_GENOME_LENGTH       1
MAX_GENOME_LENGTH       10000000

########## Phenotype ##########
DOSAGE_EFFECT       absolute

########## Target function ##########
ENV_ADD_GAUSSIAN  1.2   0.52  0.12
ENV_ADD_GAUSSIAN -1.4   0.5   0.07
ENV_ADD_GAUSSIAN  0.3   0.8   0.03
MAX_TRIANGLE_WIDTH      0.033333333

########## Recording ##########
CHECKPOINT_STEP 1000
RECORD_TREE     ON 1000
STATS_BEST      ON 100
STATS_POP       ON 100
